मनसस्तु परा बुद्धिर्यो बुद्धेः परतस्तु सः ॥ ४२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1249,\"bb\":1109,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/42/b1109/\",\"body_value\":\"indriyāṇi parāṇy āhur
indriyebhyaḥ paraṁ manaḥ
manasas tu parā buddhir
yo buddheḥ paratas tu saḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1250,\"bb\":1110,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/42/b1110/\",\"shadow_value\":\"indriyāṇi – senses; parāṇi – superior; āhuḥ – are said; indriyebhyaḥ – more than the senses; param – superior; manaḥ – the mind; manasaḥ – more than the mind; tu – also; parā – superior; buddhiḥ – intelligence; yaḥ – who; buddheḥ – more than the intelligence; parataḥ – superior; tu – but; saḥ – he.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"indriyāṇi\",\"translation\":\"senses\"},{\"word\":\"parāṇi\",\"translation\":\"superior\"},{\"word\":\"āhuḥ\",\"translation\":\"are said\"},{\"word\":\"indriyebhyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"more than the senses\"},{\"word\":\"param\",\"translation\":\"superior\"},{\"word\":\"manaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the mind\"},{\"word\":\"manasaḥ\",\"translation\":\"more than the mind\"},{\"word\":\"tu\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"parā\",\"translation\":\"superior\"},{\"word\":\"buddhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"intelligence\"},{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"who\"},{\"word\":\"buddheḥ\",\"translation\":\"more than the intelligence\"},{\"word\":\"parataḥ\",\"translation\":\"superior\"},{\"word\":\"tu\",\"translation\":\"but\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1251,\"bb\":1111,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/42/b1111/\",\"body_value\":\"The working senses are superior to dull matter; mind is higher than the senses; intelligence is still higher than the mind; and he [the soul] is even higher than the intelligence.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1252,\"bb\":1112,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/42/b1112/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1253,\"bb\":1113,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/42/b1113/\",\"body_value\":\"With intelligence one has to seek out the constitutional position of the soul and then engage the mind always in Kṛṣṇa consciousness. That solves the whole problem. A neophyte spiritualist is generally advised to keep aloof from the objects of the senses. But aside from that, one has to strengthen the mind by use of intelligence. If by intelligence one engages one’s mind in Kṛṣṇa consciousness, by complete surrender unto the Supreme Personality of Godhead, then, automatically, the mind becomes stronger, and even though the senses are very strong, like serpents, they will be no more effective than serpents with broken fangs. But even though the soul is the master of intelligence and mind, and the senses also, still, unless it is strengthened by association with Kṛṣṇa in Kṛṣṇa consciousness, there is every chance of falling down due to the agitated mind.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 3.42\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 3.42\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.